@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+# Mythical Void
+
+> Mythical Void is a free, family-friendly browser action-adventure about a
+> stranded astronaut and a procedurally varied alien companion. Players bond with their
+> companion, restore six living realms, recover their ship, and make choices
+> about what discovery and home should mean.
+
+Canonical website: https://mythicalvoid.com/
+Play in a browser: https://mythicalvoid.com/play/
+Privacy and safety: https://mythicalvoid.com/privacy/
+Terms of use: https://mythicalvoid.com/terms/
+
+Key facts:
+
+- The current browser release is free to play.
+- No account, email address, payment information, or download is required to
+  start playing.
+- Game progress is stored locally by default.
+- The game is designed to be family friendly and contains fantasy combat
+  without gore.
+- Creature genetics create varied appearances, affinities, personalities, and
+  abilities.
+- The story follows Project Beacon and the damaged ship Wanderer-77 across six
+  living realms.
+
+For general enquiries: hello@mythicalvoid.com
+For parents and guardians: parents@mythicalvoid.com
